{"id":"359d2fc3caebbb0d","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-unique-function-definition-extension.md","title":"唯一函数定义的理论扩充","display":"df-unique-function-definition-extension — 唯一函数定义的理论扩充","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-unique-function-definition-extension","aliases":["72-df-unique-function-definition-extension"],"display":"df-unique-function-definition-extension — 唯一函数定义的理论扩充","depends_on":["[[72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language]]","[[72-df-substitution-formula]]"],"chapter":"II","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.II §1.2.7, print86–88/PDF98–100; explicit local definitional extension","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-unique-function-definition-extension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-unique-function-definition-extension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-unique-function-definition-extension — 唯一函数定义的理论扩充"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5635e2f9f2823a2f\" href=\"?note=5635e2f9f2823a2f\" title=\"72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language\">72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bab190ea1c0904c8\" href=\"?note=bab190ea1c0904c8\" title=\"72-df-substitution-formula\">72-df-substitution-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"II"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.II §1.2.7, print86–88/PDF98–100; explicit local definitional extension"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}\">\\(\\mathcal L=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}(\\mathcal L)\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}(\\mathcal L)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\rho)\\subseteq\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec x)\\cup\\{y\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}(\\rho)\\subseteq\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec x)\\cup\\{y\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S^k\">\\(\\vec x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S^k\\)</span> 的分量互异，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\setminus\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec x)\">\\(y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\setminus\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec x)\\)</span>。f 为新 k 元数函数符号，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=|\\vec x|\">\\(k=|\\vec x|\\)</span>，新语言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_f\">\\(\\mathcal L_f\\)</span> 保留全部旧符号与元数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists!y\\rho\">\\(\\exists!y\\rho\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists y(\\rho\\land\\forall z(\\rho[z/y]\\to z=y))\">\\(\\exists y(\\rho\\land\\forall z(\\rho[z/y]\\to z=y))\\)</span>，z按最小下标选在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AV}(\\rho)\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec x)\\cup\\{y\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{AV}(\\rho)\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec x)\\cup\\{y\\}\\)</span> 之外。假设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\forall\\vec x\\exists!y\\rho\">\\(T\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\forall\\vec x\\exists!y\\rho\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L=\\langle R_L,F_L,C_L,a_L\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal L=\\langle R_L,F_L,C_L,a_L\\rangle\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\notin R_L\\cup F_L\\cup C_L\\cup\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(f\\notin R_L\\cup F_L\\cup C_L\\cup\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span>。本册语言允许函数元数为0，因此 k=0 仍用函数构造标签及空参数表，不与已有常元标签混同。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}:=\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}:=\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AV}:=\\operatorname{AV}_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\operatorname{AV}:=\\operatorname{AV}_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span>；扩充语言上的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\mathcal L_f}\">\\(\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\mathcal L_f}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SubFml}_{\\mathcal L_f}\">\\(\\mathrm{SubFml}_{\\mathcal L_f}\\)</span> 分别取既有全称闭包及捕获避免代入接口在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_f\">\\(\\mathcal L_f\\)</span> 的实例。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg,\\lor,\\forall\">\\(\\neg,\\lor,\\forall\\)</span> 保持基本构造；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\land,\\to,\\leftrightarrow,\\exists\">\\(\\land,\\to,\\leftrightarrow,\\exists\\)</span> 沿用同一基本语法宏。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^\\prime\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\mathcal L_f)\">\\(T^\\prime\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\mathcal L_f)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_f)\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_f)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash^=_{\\mathcal L_f}\">\\(\\vdash^=_{\\mathcal L_f}\\)</span> 取已有有限序列证明接口在扩充语言的实例。下式为该语言显式定义无上标的可证性记号。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"D_{f,\\rho}:=\\forall\\vec x\\forall y\\ (f(\\vec x)=y\\leftrightarrow\\rho),\\qquad\nT[f:\\rho]:=T\\cup\\{D_{f,\\rho}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[D_{f,\\rho}:=\\forall\\vec x\\forall y\\ (f(\\vec x)=y\\leftrightarrow\\rho),\\qquad\nT[f:\\rho]:=T\\cup\\{D_{f,\\rho}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_f:=\\langle R_L,F_L\\cup\\{f\\},C_L,a_L\\cup\\{\\langle f,k\\rangle\\}\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal L_f:=\\langle R_L,F_L\\cup\\{f\\},C_L,a_L\\cup\\{\\langle f,k\\rangle\\}\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T^\\prime\\vdash_{\\mathcal L_f}A:\\Longleftrightarrow T^\\prime\\vdash^=_{\\mathcal L_f}A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T^\\prime\\vdash_{\\mathcal L_f}A:\\Longleftrightarrow T^\\prime\\vdash^=_{\\mathcal L_f}A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是仅加入定义公理的扩充。若要允许新函数进入归纳或收集模式，还须另证相应公式类的消去保持，不由本定义自动添加所有新语言归纳。零元函数的参数表为空也在定义域内。</p>\n<p>本轮深审：函数符号、元数图及旧语言包含现在由显示结构完全指定；新鲜性使元数图之并仍为函数。零元数被源语言接口明确允许，未额外假定函数元数为正。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language","status":"resolved","id":"5635e2f9f2823a2f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-substitution-formula","status":"resolved","id":"bab190ea1c0904c8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-substitution-formula]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}(\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}(\\rho)\\subseteq\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec x)\\cup\\{y\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S^k","display":false},{"tex":"y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\setminus\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec x)","display":false},{"tex":"k=|\\vec x|","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_f","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists!y\\rho","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists y(\\rho\\land\\forall z(\\rho[z/y]\\to z=y))","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{AV}(\\rho)\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec x)\\cup\\{y\\}","display":false},{"tex":"T\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\forall\\vec x\\exists!y\\rho","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L=\\langle R_L,F_L,C_L,a_L\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"f\\notin R_L\\cup F_L\\cup C_L\\cup\\mathrm{Var}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}:=\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{AV}:=\\operatorname{AV}_{\\mathcal L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\mathcal L_f}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SubFml}_{\\mathcal L_f}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_f","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg,\\lor,\\forall","display":false},{"tex":"\\land,\\to,\\leftrightarrow,\\exists","display":false},{"tex":"T^\\prime\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\mathcal L_f)","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash^=_{\\mathcal L_f}","display":false},{"tex":"D_{f,\\rho}:=\\forall\\vec x\\forall y\\ (f(\\vec x)=y\\leftrightarrow\\rho),\\qquad\nT[f:\\rho]:=T\\cup\\{D_{f,\\rho}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_f:=\\langle R_L,F_L\\cup\\{f\\},C_L,a_L\\cup\\{\\langle f,k\\rangle\\}\\rangle.","display":true},{"tex":"T^\\prime\\vdash_{\\mathcal L_f}A:\\Longleftrightarrow T^\\prime\\vdash^=_{\\mathcal L_f}A.","display":true}],"bytes":3136,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-45","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"II章新增9项：[[72-df-bounded-unique-arithmetic-graph]] · [[72-df-division-remainder-graphs]] · [[72-df-truncated-subtraction-graph]] · [[72-df-unique-function-definition-extension]] · [[72-lem-bounded-function-occurrence-elimination]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-division]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-minimization]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-subtraction]] · [[72-thm-unique-function-definition-conservative]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-41","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"II章新增9项：[[72-df-bounded-unique-arithmetic-graph]] · [[72-df-division-remainder-graphs]] · [[72-df-truncated-subtraction-graph]] · [[72-df-unique-function-definition-extension]] · [[72-lem-bounded-function-occurrence-elimination]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-division]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-minimization]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-subtraction]] · [[72-thm-unique-function-definition-conservative]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-41","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"II章新增9项：[[72-df-bounded-unique-arithmetic-graph]] · [[72-df-division-remainder-graphs]] · [[72-df-truncated-subtraction-graph]] · [[72-df-unique-function-definition-extension]] · [[72-lem-bounded-function-occurrence-elimination]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-division]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-minimization]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-subtraction]] · [[72-thm-unique-function-definition-conservative]]"},{"id":"93e91e78693d2a69","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"152f2d2925995a62","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"参数与理论全性唯一性条件取 [[72-df-unique-function-definition-extension]]；$A\\in\\mathrm{Sent}(\\mathcal L)$。两个可证性使用各自语言的完整含等号一阶演算。"}],"outgoing":["5635e2f9f2823a2f","bab190ea1c0904c8"]}